The Anti-Zorbon Taskforce is a group that meets in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]]. [[Org/Amber Call/People/Mr. Whiskers|Mr. Whiskers]] was a proud member. Whiskers told the Party of a meeting of the taskforce; it was set for an evening during the endless rain, and the small open-air market that holds the way down into the sewers was closed when they arrived.
